  "reason": "Existing evidence shows config_018 (multimodal multiprofile with avgpool) achieves 0.6186 accuracy, suggesting multiprofile may be beneficial. However, no comparison exists between multiprofile settings across model types. This experiment tests RNA-only multiprofile with avgpool aggregation, isolating the effect of profile setting versus model modality. It directly compares multiprofile's potential value independently of multimodal fusion strategies, addressing uncertainty about whether multiprofile inherently improves performance or if multimodal approaches are required."
